# PORTFOLIO DIAMOND SPRINT
## 5-Day Professional Sprint — Diamond Portfolio with Code Animation

**Sprint Date:** April 2, 2026  
**Target State:** Production-ready developer portfolio with diamond layout, accessible code typing animation, and 4-quadrant navigation  
**Output:** Deployed portfolio at custom domain, Lighthouse 90+ all categories  
**Executor:** AI Agent (via /implement, /build, /test delegation)

---

## 📋 SPRINT METADATA

### Scope Lock Rules (CRITICAL — Read Before Any Work)

| Rule | Enforcement |
|------|-------------|
| **NO** globals.css modifications outside design tokens | All styling via Tailwind utilities + CSS variables |
| **NO** database integration | Static JSON only — no Sanity, no API calls |
| **NO** multi-page routing | Single-page application with section anchors |
| **NO** external dependencies beyond spec | Stick to: Next.js 15, Tailwind 3.4, Motion, Lucide |
| **NO** build output modifications | Static export to `dist/` only |
| **YES** accessibility first | All features must pass axe-core + screen reader |
| **YES** mobile-first verification | Every component tested at 375px, 768px, 1280px |
| **YES** reduced-motion support | `useReducedMotion()` checks required |

### Pre-Flight Lessons Applied

**CRITICAL:** `tailwind-breakpoint-shadowing` — Before any responsive work:
```bash
# Verify tailwind.config.ts has NO custom breakpoints shadowing defaults
grep -A 10 "screens:" tailwind.config.ts
# If custom lg-touch/lg-desktop exist, use those instead of lg:/md:
```

**HIGH:** `pre-flight-baseline-check` — Verify before Day 1:
```bash
npm run build
# Must pass before any sprint work begins
```

