## 📦 SCOPE CONTRACTS (6 Total)

### SC1: Project Setup & Design System — Foundation

**Gap Coverage:** N/A (Greenfield — no prior implementation)

**Target State:**
```
app/
├── globals.css          # CSS variables, Tailwind directives
├── layout.tsx           # Root layout with fonts, metadata
├── tailwind.config.ts   # Extended config with design tokens
└── page.tsx             # Placeholder shell
```

**DoD (Sequenced):**
- [ ] Pass 1: Project skeleton
  - [ ] `npm create next-app@latest` with TypeScript, Tailwind, ESLint
  - [ ] Install Motion: `npm install framer-motion@^11.0.0`
  - [ ] Install Lucide: `npm install lucide-react`
  - [ ] Install Zod: `npm install zod` (runtime validation)
  - [ ] Verify `npm run build` passes

- [ ] Pass 2: Tailwind 3.4 configuration
  - [ ] `tailwind.config.ts` with extended colors (CSS variable reference)
  - [ ] Font families: Inter, JetBrains Mono
  - [ ] **CRITICAL:** Verify no custom breakpoints shadowing defaults
  - [ ] `globals.css` with `@tailwind` directives

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 2 (Structure): CSS variables
  - [ ] Background scale: `--bg-base` through `--bg-surface-3`
  - [ ] Text scale: `--text-primary` through `--text-muted`
  - [ ] Accents: `--accent-gold`, `--accent-blue`, `--accent-green`, `--accent-red`
  - [ ] Diamond: `--diamond-glow`, `--diamond-border`

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 3 (Surface): Typography
  - [ ] Font loading with `font-display: swap`
  - [ ] Type scale: Hero 72px→40px, H1 48px→32px, Body 18px→16px

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 4 (Interaction): Verification
  - [ ] `npm run build` passes
  - [ ] Design tokens visually verified in DevTools

**Delegation:**
```
/implement "Create Next.js 15 project with TypeScript, Tailwind 3.4, Motion 11, Lucide. Set up globals.css with design tokens (CSS variables for dark luxury palette). Configure tailwind.config.ts with font families (Inter + JetBrains Mono). Verify build passes."
```

**Verification:**
```bash
npm run build
npx tailwindcss --config tailwind.config.ts --help
```

