/implement "Create data/portfolio.json with complete portfolio content. Create lib/validation.ts with Zod schema for runtime validation. Create lib/data.ts that imports JSON and validates with Zod. Export TypeScript types."
```

**Verification:**
```bash
npm run build
tsc --noEmit
```

