### SC3: Diamond Layout — Structure

**Gap Coverage:** N/A (Greenfield)

**Target State:**
```
app/components/diamond/
├── DiamondContainer.tsx      # "use client" — Main wrapper
├── AccessibleDiamond.tsx     # aria-hidden + parallel nav
└── DiamondShape.tsx           # Clip-path implementation
```

**DoD (Sequenced):**
- [ ] Pass 1: HTML skeleton
  - [ ] `DiamondContainer.tsx` with semantic structure
  - [ ] `data-testid` attributes for E2E testing
  - [ ] Placeholder quadrants

- [ ] Pass 2: Clip-path implementation
  - [ ] `DiamondShape.tsx` with CSS clip-path polygon
  - [ ] Responsive: `lg:` desktop diamond, `md:` tablet 2×2, base mobile stack
  - [ ] **CRITICAL:** Check tailwind.config.ts for custom breakpoints first!

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 2 (Structure): Accessible parallel navigation
  - [ ] `aria-hidden="true"` on visual diamond
  - [ ] `nav` with `sr-only` class containing section links
  - [ ] Semantic HTML: `ul > li > a` structure

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 3 (Surface): Visual styling
  - [ ] Diamond border with `--diamond-glow` box-shadow
  - [ ] Quadrant card styling (hover states placeholder)
  - [ ] Dark background `#121212`

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 4 (Interaction): RWD verification
  - [ ] Desktop (1280px): Diamond + 4 quadrants positioned
  - [ ] Tablet (768px): Center diamond + 2×2 grid
  - [ ] Mobile (375px): Stacked cards
  - [ ] All breakpoints verified in DevTools

**Delegation:**
```
/implement "Create diamond layout components. DiamondContainer.tsx (use client), AccessibleDiamond.tsx with aria-hidden visual + parallel sr-only navigation. DiamondShape.tsx with clip-path polygon. Implement responsive: desktop diamond with positioned quadrants, tablet 2x2 grid, mobile stacked. Test all 3 breakpoints."
```

**Verification:**
```bash
npm run build
npx playwright test tests/e2e/diamond-layout.spec.ts
```

