## ⚠️ REGRESSION CONTAINMENT

### Files at Risk

| File | Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------|------------|
| `globals.css` | Overwritten by Tailwind | Verify design tokens preserved after any CSS changes |
| `tailwind.config.ts` | Custom breakpoints added | Reject any PR adding `screens:` without review |
| `page.tsx` | Structure changes | E2E test `data-testid` attributes must remain stable |

### Pre-Sprint Baseline

```bash
# EXECUTE BEFORE DAY 1:
git checkout -b portfolio-sprint-2026-04-02
npm install
npm run build
# CAPTURE BASELINE
```

### Regression Test Suite

```typescript
// tests/e2e/regression.spec.ts
test.describe('Regression Containment', () => {
  test('build passes', async () => {
    // Ensure npm run build succeeds
    const build = spawn('npm', ['run', 'build']);
    await expect(build).toExit(0);
  });
  
  test('design tokens exist', async ({ page }) => {
    await page.goto('/');
    const body = page.locator('body');
    // Check CSS variables applied
    await expect(body).toHaveCSS('background-color', /rgb\(18, 18, 18\)/);
  });
});
```

