## 🎯 DELEGATION COMMANDS

### Execution Sequence

```
DAY 1: /implement SC1
  ├─ /build: Pass 1 → Pass 2 → Pass 3 Layers
  └─ /test after each DoD

DAY 2: /implement SC2
  ├─ /build: Pass 1 → Pass 2 → Pass 3
  └─ /test after each DoD

DAY 3: /implement SC3
  ├─ /build: Pass 1 → Pass 2 → Pass 3 Layers
  └─ /test after each DoD

DAY 4: /implement SC4 + SC5
  ├─ /build SC4: Pass 1 → Pass 2 → Pass 3 Layers
  ├─ /test SC4
  ├─ /build SC5: Pass 1 → Pass 2 → Pass 3 Layers
  └─ /test SC5

DAY 5: /implement SC6
  ├─ /build: Pass 1 → Pass 2 → Pass 3 Layers
  ├─ /test
  ├─ Manual verification (screen reader)
  └─ Deploy
```

### Per-Contract Command Pattern

```
/implement "[Exact scope from SC above]"
  → AI executes Pass 1
  → /test verifies
  → AI executes Pass 2
  → /test verifies
  → AI executes Pass 3 Layers sequentially
  → /test verifies each Layer
  → SC marked complete
```

