## 🏁 SPRINT LOCK CRITERIA

**Sprint is LOCKED when:**
1. ✅ All specification tests pass (100%)
2. ✅ All critical regressions contained (baseline = current)
3. ✅ Build gate passed (`npm run build` succeeds)
4. ✅ Lighthouse scores ≥ 90 all categories
5. ✅ Manual accessibility verification complete

**DO NOT MODIFY SPRINT after lock.**

